{"metas":[{"id":"tt39230035","type":"series","name":"Would You Rather: Decide to Survive","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//3prao5rbnwzaEIvyVzpj6hjNVQn.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt39230035/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt39230035/img","description":"Would You Rather be invisible or be able to fly? Fight one giant duck or 1000 tiny ducks? Eat a man-sized bean or a bean-sized man? This comedy game show will see two teams of some of Britain's funniest digital personalities compete in hilarious real-life challenges based on classic hypothetical Would You Rather decisions. These three simple words decide everything from what they eat to who they send home.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt40184737","type":"series","name":"Ab Hoga Hisaab","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//4QKn1CDbWnONAeBbZsyDM2mfp4k.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt40184737/img","description":"Recently-deported NRI Bobby's life shatters when brother Bunty vanishes. His search exposes a human-trafficking ring masked as a Canada immigration network. With Inspector Dosanjh's help, Bobby battles corruption to save his brother.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt43135948","type":"series","name":"Sidemen Presents: Side-Menu","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//v2IRWIhbyaQLx0LF14TUfFy47N7.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//v2IRWIhbyaQLx0LF14TUfFy47N7.jpg","description":"The Sidemen are joined by a guest contestant as they take on a series of culinary challenges – a starter, main and dessert – with teams rotating every episode and individual points on the line.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt43509012","type":"series","name":"Chloe et Emma","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//zUHE73VCTCnXifdBXdNUxGF3aek.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt43509012/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt43509012/img","description":"Having lost love, her job, and her home, Emma had hit rock bottom when she stumbled upon the estate of Chloe, a mysterious heiress. Unexpected happenings lead the two of them to become housemates, and together, they open a fortune-telling shop where troubled souls come searching for answers. The pair soon realize that each client's problem comes with hidden secrets and mysteries.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt35870921","type":"series","name":"Raakh","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//r6SEQaSUmtl6S076AEDd5qkLaAD.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt35870921/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt35870921/img","description":"When two teenagers vanish, a close-knit family is shattered and the city is left on edge. Determined to uncover the truth, a relentless officer leads a nationwide manhunt that pulls him deep into a world of violence and human depravity.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt33055254","type":"series","name":"Every Year After","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//nZGf0jnSJNXLf8o7iSzzX8qxHX9.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt33055254/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt33055254/img","description":"Six summers to fall in love. One moment to fall apart. A week to get it right. A fun, sweeping, romantic story that asks the question, what if your first love actually was your soulmate?","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt3722230","type":"series","name":"The Ultimate Rider","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//tG8QDzwOwnxlHHrpZrjoqzswoVd.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//tG8QDzwOwnxlHHrpZrjoqzswoVd.jpg","description":"The Ultimate Rider is a high-performance reality series built to find the next professional motocross athlete. Sixteen riders. Two weeks. No outside contact. No second chances. Through relentless training, competition, and pressure, riders are pushed to their limits—physically, mentally, and emotionally. There are no eliminations. Only performance. Only progression. At the end, one rider earns a contract—and a future in professional motocross.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt42761339","type":"series","name":"Ticket to the Tribes","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//bnyAgpU8pMEZGdgjl3x9it1C0KS.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt42761339/img","description":"In the new reality show, 12 Dutch and Flemish celebrities live together with the Himba community in Namibia. This means that the participants must live without modern amenities and adapt to the tribe's way of life. The participants are judged on their commitment and respect for the culture. The celebrities who adapt the least are eliminated. Ultimately, one participant remains. This person is appointed an honorary member by the community.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt38589437","type":"series","name":"The Pyramid Scheme","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//34sjPzz8xZCORirlywAJp1gUUyJ.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt38589437/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt38589437/img","description":"Follows the story of Goldy, an ambitious but impatient young man, whose quest to get rich through a pyramid marketing business spirals into a rollercoaster of chaos - risking not just his future, but also the love and trust of his close-knit joint family.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tmdb:324707","type":"series","name":"Patrocínio","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//r1DZd5rka497nbkN0kVJlVu2bdE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//r1DZd5rka497nbkN0kVJlVu2bdE.jpg","description":"In a world dominated by filters and controlled narratives, \"Patrocinio\" breaks with the formality of one of Portugal's most influential families to offer an intimate and unprecedented access to the sisters' world. The camera ceases to be a guest at gala events and instead portrays the emotional, professional, and familial structure that sustains an empire of influence, work, and sisterhood.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt44871098","type":"series","name":"7 vs. Wild: Wildcard Competition","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//fEUPkDKEAPMXUv9MmaFG7rcj3BW.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt44871098/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt44871098/img","description":"","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt42207572","type":"series","name":"L'Affaire Céline Giboire - une contre-enquête de McSkyz","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//ibvf49RExx4dC6HdZmX8554ObIw.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt42207572/img","description":"On February 28, 2012, the body of 16-year-old Céline Giboire was found at the foot of a cliff in the Corbières park in Saint-Malo. Since then, her family has rejected the suicide theory put forward by the authorities and has fought to uncover the truth about the circumstances of her death. McSkyz revisits the case in an attempt to understand what happened to Céline.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt39221314","type":"series","name":"The 50","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//tqmEZksj5AMYphDzr0WDCF7Z7I3.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt39221314/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt39221314/img","description":"Tension and strategy, clashes and provocations, but also fun, relationships and friendships, are the ingredients of The 50, the new reality game in which 50 of the most popular Italian celebrities and influencers will compete in a series of tests.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt50760081","type":"series","name":"Beating the Odds","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//9jodzeEKpKeh8UvINi6INmcgfAu.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt50760081/img","description":"BEATing The Odds: BEAT is charting a new course. After a winless streak, the team has decided to make a change. With a new structure and renewed ambition, the quest for improvement begins. But in a sport where every detail matters, the question is: is this enough to truly break through?","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt43616085","type":"series","name":"Offline med Isa & Tilda","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//zZ8c3wmFT7tmt2RH8HZETlAkxeH.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//zZ8c3wmFT7tmt2RH8HZETlAkxeH.jpg","description":"In the first season of OFFLINE, Isa and Tilda leave the big city, screens and likes. Stureplan is exchanged for a farm, TikTok for tractors and high heels for rubber boots. No mobile, no champagne, no shopping - just cows, chaos and total shock. Laughter, tears, anger and frustration. Patience and friendship are put to the test. It's iconic, crazy and unforgettable. A season you don't want to miss!","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt38856253","type":"series","name":"EXAM","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//9jt62J8sfq8pFFovZhEQmxjUqhb.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt38856253/img","description":"A determined young woman with a mysterious past enters the dangerous world of the Regional Public Service Exam (RPSE) scam to expose a powerful paper-leak network. But as she digs deeper, she uncovers a corruption chain embedded deep within the education system-and must bring it down before it destroys the dreams of an entire generation.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt33546863","type":"series","name":"Off Campus","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//tcPc5ZMBO4y2BtCJMe3o2nwZb2B.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt33546863/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt33546863/img","description":"Hannah Wells tutors hockey captain Garrett Graham to win over her crush. Their deal becomes real connection as they face their pasts. Friends Logan, Dean, Tucker, and Allie navigate college life and love.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt40859434","type":"series","name":"Lukkhe","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//w8GLkht5ceCi7KQ3AMD77mzkxBc.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt40859434/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt40859434/img","description":"A young sportsman infiltrates the wild and dangerous world of Punjab's rap music to investigate a drug syndicate, only to find himself torn between love, family, guilt and brotherhood.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt7631058","type":"series","name":"The Lord of the Rings: The Rings of Power","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/Njc1wi8WgXh2uhJ6nx-6XPBgo_Q=/ems.cHJkLWVtcy1hc3NldHMvdHZzZXJpZXMvM2M3YzNlMDItYmQ1Yy00NGIzLWEwYzctZDc3MDlmMWZmZDhhLmpwZw==","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt7631058/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt7631058/img","description":"Tomatometer 84%"},{"id":"tt0784896","type":"series","name":"Mickey Mouse Clubhouse+","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/kW8MteMEPcHC9HtSvTESJOX5pZU=/ems.cHJkLWVtcy1hc3NldHMvdHZzZXJpZXMvM2VjOTU5OWItNDk5OS00ZDQ5LWI1ZmMtMThiMDk4ZjlhNDY1LmpwZw==","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt0784896/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt0784896/img","description":""},{"id":"tt2805096","type":"series","name":"Chicago P.D.","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/-XZAfHZM39UwaGJIFWKAE8fS0ak=/v3/t/assets/p9972948_b_v12_cl.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt2805096/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt2805096/img","description":""},{"id":"tt2261391","type":"series","name":"Chicago Fire","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/-XZAfHZM39UwaGJI